  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dsh-hud",
      "text": "[](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@konnga/dsh-hud) [](#安装) [](LICENSE)\n\n[English](./README.en.md) | **中文**\n\nDSH 底部多一行：分支和改动状态、正在跑什么、本次会话多久、还剩多少钱，再配一只会跟着工具换姿势的鲸鱼娘。"
    },
    {
      "section": "安装",
      "text": "桌面端「设置 → 插件 → 添加插件」，填 `@konnga/dsh-hud`。\n\n本地开发时把 profile 依赖指向仓库（客户端代码要重启应用才重读）：\n\n```json\n\"@konnga/dsh-hud\": \"link:/path/to/dsh-hud\"\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "功能总览",
      "text": "```\ndsh-hud · git:(main*) ↑1 ↓2 M4 A1 ?1 │ ●3   │   ✓ bash ×16 │ …   │   ⏱ 2h 14m   │  ¥128.40+\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "功能总览",
      "text": "| 功能         | 看到什么                                                           | 在哪儿           |\n| ------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------ | ---------------- |\n| **Git**      | 工作区名、分支、`↑`/`↓`、改动计数、本会话改过几个文件              | 行首，点它开面板 |\n| **工具**     | 正在跑的命令（秒数实时跳）、各工具调用次数、用过的技能             | 中间             |\n| **会话计时** | 本次会话跑了多久；悬停给模型/工具耗时与轮次                        | 右二             |\n| **余额**     | 跟着当前会话的模型来源走：官方账号、自己的 Key、中转站各有各的账本 | 最右             |\n| **面板**     | 改动概览、清单、最近提交、标签，点一行看差异                       | 点 Git 胶囊      |\n| **轮尾耗时** | 每条回复后面补上这一轮花了多久                                     | 回复下方动作栏   |"
    },
    {
      "section": "胶囊",
      "text": "- **Git**：`M4 A1 ?1` 只列非零项（`M` 改 `A` 增 `D` 删 `R` 重命名 `C` 复制 `T` 类型 `?` 未跟踪 `!` 冲突）；`●3` 是本会话改过 3 个文件；`*` 表示工作区不干净。\n- **工具**：`✓`/`✗` 是它**自己最近一次**调用的结果；`skills:` 后面是技能名而不是次数；最多铺 3 个工具 + 2 个技能，其余收成 `+k`。\n- **会话计时**：`现在 − 第一条 turn/start`，含中间的等待与空闲。用第一条消息而不是创建时刻——空会话可能闲置好几天，按创建算会出现「16 天」。\n- **余额**：用官方账号查账号钱包，用中转站查那家的余额；读不到就画 `--`，绝不拿别人的数顶上。左键立即刷新，右键开平台用量页。\n- 悬停气泡是插件自己画的（原生 tooltip 在真机上不出现）。"
    },
    {
      "section": "每轮耗时",
      "text": "回复动作栏本来只有结束时刻，现在后面多一段：\n\n```\n用量 13.9M tok    21:05 · 5 分 46 秒\n```\n\n开关在「设置 → 通用 → 对话 → 显示每轮耗时」。"
    },
    {
      "section": "思考动画",
      "text": "四选一：官方、Q版鲸鱼娘、赛博鲸鱼娘、长裙鲸鱼娘。\n\n鲸鱼娘有 30 种动作，跟着当前工具和 100 条轮播，每 6 秒更换。运行时左侧是动作、上方是用时、下方是文案：\n\n赛博鲸鱼娘是另一套 30 张工装风。长裙鲸鱼娘 9 张，没画到的动作回退到思考图。\n\n[全部文案](docs/running-text.md) · [资源维护](docs/whale-assets.md)"
    },
    {
      "section": "表情包",
      "text": "「表情包」页可以用自己的图建包、ZIP 导入导出、给动作映射、单张替换、删除。只要求一张默认思考图，没配的动作复用这张，不会混进别的角色。素材存在宿主独立数据域，不写进插件目录，也不进 localStorage。\n\n[使用方法与 ZIP 规范](docs/expression-packs.md) · [可导入的示例包](docs/expression-packs/cyber-whale-girl.zip)"
    },
    {
      "section": "设置",
      "text": "齿轮胶囊打开「DSH HUD 设置」：\n\n- **常规**：胶囊显示（Git / 工具 / 余额 / 会话计时）+ 对话（每轮耗时）。全隐藏了齿轮还在。\n- **表情包**：皮肤、角色图片尺寸、显示用时、自定义包。\n- **余额管理**：中转站列表与余额查询，密钥默认遮罩，可查看/复制，不落盘。\n\n`Esc` 或点浮层外侧关闭。新增的宿主接口需要重启 DSH 才加载。"
    },
    {
      "section": "面板",
      "text": "点 Git 胶囊打开：改动概览、逐文件清单、最近提交、标签；点任意一行看差异，右侧可拖动调整大小。未暂存/已暂存分开，支持自动换行、复制差异、图片并排对比与缩放。\n\n面板内快捷键：`↑↓` 选行，`Enter` 打开，`[ ]` 切标签，`n p` 上下条差异，`Space` 翻页，`v` 切换视图，`r` 刷新，`Esc` 关闭。"
    },
    {
      "section": "侧栏与其它",
      "text": "- 侧栏每个会话行悬停或点 `⋯`：git 摘要 + 本会话归因。\n- 回复末尾「本轮图片改动」：这一轮动过的图，点开看单张，`⇄` 看前后对比。"
    },
    {
      "section": "开发",
      "text": "```bash\npnpm install\npnpm typecheck   # 类型检查\npnpm test        # 全量用例\npnpm build       # 产出 lib/（宿主端 + 客户端 bundle）"
    },
    {
      "section": "dsh-hud",
      "text": "[](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@konnga/dsh-hud) [](#install) [](LICENSE)\n\n**English** | [中文](./README.md)\n\nOne extra row under your composer: branch and change state, what is running, how long this session has been going, how much credit is left — plus a whale girl who changes pose with the tool in play.\n\n> Screenshots are from the Chinese UI; the plugin's own labels follow your UI language."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "Desktop: **Settings → Plugins → Add plugin**, then `@konnga/dsh-hud`.\n\nFor local development, point the profile at the checkout (client code is re-read on app restart):\n\n```json\n\"@konnga/dsh-hud\": \"link:/path/to/dsh-hud\"\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "Feature overview",
      "text": "```\ndsh-hud · git:(main*) ↑1 ↓2 M4 A1 ?1 │ ●3   │   ✓ bash ×16 │ …   │   ⏱ 2h 14m   │  ¥128.40+\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "Feature overview",
      "text": "| Feature           | What you see                                                                                | Where                             |\n| ----------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------- |\n| **Git**           | Workspace, branch, `↑`/`↓`, change counts, files this session touched                       | Leftmost; click to open the panel |\n| **Tools**         | What is running (live seconds), per-tool counts, skills used                                | Middle                            |\n| **Session timer** | How long this session has run; hover for model/tool time and turns                          | Second from right                 |\n| **Balance**       | Follows the session's model provider — account, own key, or relay, each with its own ledger | Rightmost                         |\n| **Panel**         | Overview, file list, recent commits, tags; click a row for its diff                         | Click the Git capsule             |\n| **Turn duration** | How long each turn took, next to its clock                                                  | Actions row under ea"
    },
    {
      "section": "Capsules",
      "text": "- **Git**: `M4 A1 ?1` lists only non-zero counts (`M` modified, `A` added, `D` deleted, `R` renamed, `C` copied, `T` type, `?` untracked, `!` conflict); `●3` = 3 files touched this session; `*` = dirty worktree.\n- **Tools**: `✓`/`✗` is that tool's **own last** result; `skills:` lists skill names, not counts; shows 3 tools + 2 skills, the rest collapse to `+k`.\n- **Session timer**: `now − first turn/start`, including idle gaps. It starts at the first message rather than file creation — an empty session can sit for days, which would render as \"16d\".\n- **Balance**: an official account reads the account wallet, a relay reads its own balance; when unreadable it shows `--` rather than borrowing another number. Left-click refreshes, right-click opens the provider's usage page.\n- Hover bubbles are drawn by the plugin (native tooltips never appear in the real app)."
    },
    {
      "section": "Turn duration",
      "text": "The actions row used to show only the end clock. Now:\n\n```\n用量 13.9M tok    21:05 · 5m 46s\n```\n\nToggle it at **Settings → General → Chat → Turn duration**."
    },
    {
      "section": "Thinking animation",
      "text": "Four choices: Official, Chibi Whale Girl, Cyber Whale Girl, Longdress Whale Girl.\n\nThe whale girl has 30 poses tied to the current tool and a pool of 100 cues, rotating every 6 seconds. While running: pose on the left, elapsed time above, phrase below:\n\nCyber Whale Girl is a second 30-pose techwear set. Longdress has 9 poses; anything unmapped falls back to the thinking image.\n\n[All phrases](docs/running-text.md) · [Asset maintenance](docs/whale-assets.md)"
    },
    {
      "section": "Expression packs",
      "text": "The **Expression packs** tab lets you build a pack from your own images, import/export ZIPs, map actions, replace single images and delete packs. Only one default thinking image is required; unmapped actions reuse it instead of borrowing another character. Images and selection live in a dedicated Host storage domain — not the plugin directory, not localStorage.\n\n[Usage and ZIP format](docs/expression-packs.md) · [Importable example](docs/expression-packs/cyber-whale-girl.zip)"
    },
    {
      "section": "Settings",
      "text": "The gear capsule opens DSH HUD settings:\n\n- **General**: capsule visibility (Git / tools / balance / session timer) + chat (turn duration). The gear stays even if every capsule is hidden.\n- **Expression packs**: skins, image size (32–104px), elapsed time, custom packs.\n- **Balance management**: relays and balance queries; keys are masked, revealable, copyable, never persisted.\n\nClose with `Esc` or a click outside. New Host endpoints need a DSH restart to load."
    },
    {
      "section": "Panel",
      "text": "Click the Git capsule: overview, per-file list, recent commits, tags. Click a row for its diff — the right pane is draggable. Unstaged and staged are separate; word wrap, copy diff, and side-by-side image comparison with zoom are supported.\n\nShortcuts inside the panel: `↑↓` to move, `Enter` to open, `[ ]` for tabs, `n p` for next/previous hunk, `Space` to page, `v` to switch view, `r` to refresh, `Esc` to close."
    },
    {
      "section": "Sidebar and more",
      "text": "- Every sidebar session row expands on hover or `⋯`: git summary + per-session attribution.\n- \"Per-turn image changes\" at the end of a reply: images touched this turn, click to view one, `⇄` for before/after."
    },
    {
      "section": "Development",
      "text": "```bash\npnpm install\npnpm typecheck   # types\npnpm test        # full suite\npnpm build       # lib/ (host + client bundle)"
    }
  ],
